OL,3,GNEWSA4,000-seat Leamington FC stadium
OL,4,Aplan submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to build a new 4,000 seat
OL,7,Fstadium for a non-league football team
OL,8,Fhave been submitted, more than 10 years
OL,9,Fafter the move was proposed.
OL,11,FLeamington FC, which plays in Southern
OL,12,FLeague Premier Central Division, want
OL,13,Fto build a new ground, along with 85
OL,14,Fapartments, on land at Fusilier Way in
OL,15,FWarwick.
OL,17,FIf approved by Warwick District
OL,18,FCouncil, the club said it could
OL,19,Fre-locate between 2029 and 2031.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
