OL,3,GNEWSA4,000-seat Leamington FC stadium
OL,4,Aplan submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FChairman Jim Scott said submitting the
OL,7,Fplans was a positive step. ""Clearly
OL,8,Fthere is still a lot of work to be done
OL,9,Fto reach the point where the council
OL,10,Fcan make decisions but this is a
OL,11,Fproject with immense community benefit
OL,12,Fin terms of health and wellbeing."
